{"text": "El zorro empezó a elogiar el brillo de las plumas del cuervo. Dijo que parecía el ave más elegante del bosque. El cuervo escuchó con agrado, sin notar que los ojos del zorro seguían pendientes del queso. Zorro: Con esas plumas, seguro que tienes una voz preciosa.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.345374, "from": 0, "to": 2}, {"start": 0.360125, "end": 0.699791, "from": 3, "to": 8}, {"start": 0.714583, "end": 1.187166, "from": 9, "to": 15}, {"start": 1.201958, "end": 1.290583, "from": 16, "to": 17}, {"start": 1.305333, "end": 1.792708, "from": 18, "to": 25}, {"start": 1.807458, "end": 1.940374, "from": 26, "to": 28}, {"start": 1.955125, "end": 2.309583, "from": 29, "to": 35}, {"start": 2.324333, "end": 2.457249, "from": 36, "to": 38}, {"start": 2.472041, "end": 2.693582, "from": 39, "to": 42}, {"start": 2.708333, "end": 3.151374, "from": 43, "to": 49}, {"start": 3.166125, "end": 3.313791, "from": 50, "to": 53}, {"start": 3.328583, "end": 3.845458, "from": 54, "to": 60}, {"start": 4.873583, "end": 5.287083, "from": 62, "to": 66}, {"start": 5.301875, "end": 5.434791, "from": 67, "to": 70}, {"start": 5.449541, "end": 6.040291, "from": 71, "to": 78}, {"start": 6.055041, "end": 6.187957, "from": 79, "to": 81}, {"start": 6.20275, "end": 6.39475, "from": 82, "to": 85}, {"start": 6.4095, "end": 6.719625, "from": 86, "to": 89}, {"start": 6.734416, "end": 7.295624, "from": 90, "to": 98}, {"start": 7.310375, "end": 7.502375, "from": 99, "to": 102}, {"start": 7.517125, "end": 8.01925, "from": 103, "to": 109}, {"start": 9.038291, "end": 9.259832, "from": 111, "to": 113}, {"start": 9.274583, "end": 9.614249, "from": 114, "to": 120}, {"start": 9.629, "end": 10.086833, "from": 121, "to": 128}, {"start": 10.101625, "end": 10.293625, "from": 129, "to": 132}, {"start": 10.308375, "end": 10.8105, "from": 133, "to": 139}, {"start": 11.150166, "end": 11.356916, "from": 141, "to": 144}, {"start": 11.371708, "end": 11.770458, "from": 145, "to": 150}, {"start": 11.785208, "e